+# SANKALP – Locked dependency versions
+# ======================================
+# Generated by resolving requirements.txt against the latest release inside
+# each package's currently-allowed major version (via the PyPI JSON API), to
+# keep installs reproducible across machines and CI runs.
+#
+# Regenerate after any intentional version bump:
+#   python -m venv .lockenv && .lockenv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt
+#   .lockenv/bin/pip freeze | grep -v "^-e" > requirements.lock.txt
+#
+# Install from this file for a byte-for-byte reproducible environment:
+#   pip install -r requirements.lock.txt --index-url https://pypi.org/simple \
+#       --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
